[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 25383.59, "timestamp": "07:03:03", "text": "我想放一個，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25386.15, "timestamp": "07:03:06", "text": "你知道，嗯，嗯，該怎麼稱呼它呢？呃，那是什麼來著？就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25402.948, "timestamp": "07:03:22", "text": "那個綠幕設備，對吧？是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25405.99, "timestamp": "07:03:25", "text": "我當時想，我不知道。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25409.27, "timestamp": "07:03:29", "text": "覺得我永遠"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25418.868, "timestamp": "07:03:38", "text": "不會用到綠幕，但是，我確實考慮過一些事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25422.43, "timestamp": "07:03:42", "text": "。  好吧，那將會是我的專屬"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25428.948, "timestamp": "07:03:48", "text": "房間，就像是為我訂製的那種房間。所以，我真的非常興奮，我就想，「是啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 25437.91, "timestamp": "07:03:57", "text": "我想做。"}]